{
  "dom_id": "step-t3093",
  "name": "Introduction",
  "problem": "Let's calculate $(\\sqrt{100})^2$ by performing each operation one step at a time:\n\n$$\n(\\sqrt{\\color{blue}100})^2 = \\left(\\sqrt{{\\color{red}10}^2}\\right)^2 = ({\\color{red}10})^2 = {\\color{blue}100}\n$$\n\nNotice that the squaring the square root gives the number under the square root:\n\n$$\n\\left( \\sqrt{100} \\right)^2 = 100\n$$\n\nThis result holds in general for any non-negative number. If $\\color{blue}\\square$ is any positive number or zero, then\n\n$$\n(\\sqrt{\\color{blue}\\square})^2 = {\\color{blue}\\square}\\,.\n$$\n\nThe square and the square root cancel each other out, and we're left with the number that we started with.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14151756/assets/1fa29ca192dc3fb99f4180c300aa3120064e3682361d175a698b1d457a569ba0.png)",
  "worked_solution": "",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-t3093\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\">\n    \n               \n                <div class=\"tutorial\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Introduction</span></div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"t3093\">?</div>\n                    </div>                    \n    \n                    <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>Let's calculate <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"8.287ex\" height=\"3.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1006.6 3567.9 1367.4\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">(\\sqrt{100})^2</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-28\" d=\"M94 250Q94 319 104 381T127 488T164 576T202 643T244 695T277 729T302 750H315H319Q333 750 333 741Q333 738 316 72