-176Q479 -303 469 -324T453 -348Q449 -350 436 -350L424 -349L315 -96Q206 156 205 156L171 130Q138 104 137 104L111 130L263 249Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJSZ2-28\" d=\"M180 96T180 250T205 541T266 770T353 944T444 1069T527 1150H555Q561 1144 561 1141Q561 1137 545 1120T504 1072T447 995T386 878T330 721T288 513T272 251Q272 133 280 56Q293 -87 326 -209T399 -405T475 -531T536 -609T561 -640Q561 -643 555 -649H527Q483 -612 443 -568T353 -443T266 -270T205 -41Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJSZ2-29\" d=\"M35 1138Q35 1150 51 1150H56H69Q113 1113 153 1069T243 944T330 771T391 541T416 250T391 -40T330 -270T243 -443T152 -568T69 -649H56Q43 -649 39 -647T35 -637Q65 -607 110 -548Q283 -316 316 56Q324 133 324 251Q324 368 316 445Q278 877 48 1123Q36 1137 35 1138Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(389,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-221A\" x=\"0\" y=\"-2\"></use>\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"1501\" height=\"60\" x=\"833\" y=\"739\"></rect>\n<g transform=\"translate(833,0)\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"1001\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(2724,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"550\" y=\"583\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"3845\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(4901,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJSZ2-28\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(597,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJSZ1-221A\" x=\"0\" y=\"156\"></use>\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"1454\" height=\"60\" x=\"1000\" y=\"947\"></rect>\n<g transform=\"translate(1000,0)\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"1415\" y=\"583\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJSZ2-29\" x=\"3052\" y=\"-1\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"5162\" y=\"1240\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"9284\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"10340\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(10729,0)\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(11730,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"550\" y=\"583\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"12852\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(13908,0)\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"1001\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Notice that the squaring the square root gives the number under the square root:\n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"15.193ex\" height=\"3.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -1.005ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1150.1 6541.5 1582.7\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n\\left( \\sqrt{100} \\right)^2 = 100\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-28\" d=\"M94 250Q94 319 104 381T127 488T164 576T202 643T244 695T277 729T302 750H315H319Q333 750 333 741Q333 738 316 720T275 667T226 581T184 443T167 250T184 58T225 -81T274 -167T316 -220T333 -241Q333 -250 318 -250H315H302L274 -226Q180 -141 137 -14T94 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-31\" d=\"M213 578L200 573Q186 568 160 563T102 556H83V602H102Q149 604 189 617T245 641T273 663Q275 666 285 666Q294 666 302 660V361L303 61Q310 54 315 52T339 48T401 46H427V0H416Q395 3 257 3Q121 3 100 0H88V46H114Q136 46 152 46T177 47T193 50T201 52T207 57T213 61V578Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-30\" d=\"M96 585Q152 666 249 666Q297 666 345 640T423 548Q460 465 460 320Q460 165 417 83Q397 41 362 16T301 -15T250 -22Q224 -22 198 -16T137 16T82 83Q39 165 39 320Q39 494 96 585ZM321 597Q291 629 250 629Q208 629 178 597Q153 571 145 525T137 333Q137 175 145 125T181 46Q209 16 250 16Q290 16 318 46Q347 76 354 130T362 333Q362 478 354 524T321 597Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-221A\" d=\"M95 178Q89 178 81 186T72 200T103 230T169 280T207 309Q209 311 212 311H213Q219 311 227 294T281 177Q300 134 312 108L397 -77Q398 -77 501 136T707 565T814 786Q820 800 834 800Q841 800 846 794T853 782V776L620 293L385 -193Q381 -200 366 -200Q357 -200 354 -197Q352 -195 256 15L160 225L144 214Q129 202 113 190T95 178Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-29\" d=\"M60 749L64 750Q69 750 74 750H86L114 726Q208 641 251 514T294 250Q294 182 284 119T261 12T224 -76T186 -143T145 -194T113 -227T90 -246Q87 -249 86 -250H74Q66 -250 63 -250T58 -247T55 -238Q56 -237 66 -225Q221 -64 221 250T66 725Q56 737 55 738Q55 746 60 749Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJSZ1-28\" d=\"M152 251Q152 646 388 850H416Q422 844 422 841Q422 837 403 816T357 753T302 649T255 482T236 250Q236 124 255 19T301 -147T356 -251T403 -315T422 -340Q422 -343 416 -349H388Q359 -325 332 -296T271 -213T212 -97T170 56T152 251Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJSZ1-29\" d=\"M305 251Q305 -145 69 -349H56Q43 -349 39 -347T35 -338Q37 -333 60 -307T108 -239T160 -136T204 27T221 250T204 473T160 636T108 740T60 807T35 839Q35 850 50 850H56H69Q197 743 256 566Q305 425 305 251Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-32\" d=\"M109 429Q82 429 66 447T50 491Q50 562 103 614T235 666Q326 666 387 610T449 465Q449 422 429 383T381 315T301 241Q265 210 201 149L142 93L218 92Q375 92 385 97Q392 99 409 186V189H449V186Q448 183 436 95T421 3V0H50V19V31Q50 38 56 46T86 81Q115 113 136 137Q145 147 170 174T204 211T233 244T261 278T284 308T305 340T320 369T333 401T340 431T343 464Q343 527 309 573T212 619Q179 619 154 602T119 569T109 550Q109 549 114 549Q132 549 151 535T170 489Q170 464 154 447T109 429Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-3D\" d=\"M56 347Q56 360 70 367H707Q722 359 722 347Q722 336 708 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347ZM56 153Q56 168 72 173H708Q722 163 722 153Q722 140 707 133H70Q56 140 56 153Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJSZ1-28\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(458,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-221A\" x=\"0\" y=\"-2\"></use>\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"1501\" height=\"60\" x=\"833\" y=\"739\"></rect>\n<g transform=\"translate(833,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"1001\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJSZ1-29\" x=\"2793\" y=\"-1\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"4599\" y=\"828\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"3983\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(5039,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"1001\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>This result holds in general for any non-negative number. If <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.808ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 778.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\\color{blue}\\square</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJAMS-25A1\" d=\"M71 0Q59 4 55 16V346L56 676Q64 686 70 689H709Q719 681 722 674V15Q719 10 709 1L390 0H71ZM682 40V649H95V40H682Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E4-MJAMS-25A1\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span> is any positive number or zero, then\n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"12.548ex\" height=\"3.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1006.6 5402.6 1367.4\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\">\n\t(\\sqrt{\\color{blue}\\square})^2 = {\\color{blue}\\square}\\,.\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-28\" d=\"M94 250Q94 319 104 381T127 488T164 576T202 643T244 695T277 729T302 750H315H319Q333 750 333 741Q333 738 316 720T275 667T226 581T184 443T167 250T184 58T225 -81T274 -167T316 -220T333 -241Q333 -250 318 -250H315H302L274 -226Q180 -141 137 -14T94 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJAMS-25A1\" d=\"M71 0Q59 4 55 16V346L56 676Q64 686 70 689H709Q719 681 722 674V15Q719 10 709 1L390 0H71ZM682 40V649H95V40H682Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-221A\" d=\"M95 178Q89 178 81 186T72 200T103 230T169 280T207 309Q209 311 212 311H213Q219 311 227 294T281 177Q300 134 312 108L397 -77Q398 -77 501 136T707 565T814 786Q820 800 834 800Q841 800 846 794T853 782V776L620 293L385 -193Q381 -200 366 -200Q357 -200 354 -197Q352 -195 256 15L160 225L144 214Q129 202 113 190T95 178Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-29\" d=\"M60 749L64 750Q69 750 74 750H86L114 726Q208 641 251 514T294 250Q294 182 284 119T261 12T224 -76T186 -143T145 -194T113 -227T90 -246Q87 -249 86 -250H74Q66 -250 63 -250T58 -247T55 -238Q56 -237 66 -225Q221 -64 221 250T66 725Q56 737 55 738Q55 746 60 749Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-32\" d=\"M109 429Q82 429 66 447T50 491Q50 562 103 614T235 666Q326 666 387 610T449 465Q449 422 429 383T381 315T301 241Q265 210 201 149L142 93L218 92Q375 92 385 97Q392 99 409 186V189H449V186Q448 183 436 95T421 3V0H50V19V31Q50 38 56 46T86 81Q115 113 136 137Q145 147 170 174T204 211T233 244T261 278T284 308T305 340T320 369T333 401T340 431T343 464Q343 527 309 573T212 619Q179 619 154 602T119 569T109 550Q109 549 114 549Q132 549 151 535T170 489Q170 464 154 447T109 429Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-3D\" d=\"M56 347Q56 360 70 367H707Q722 359 722 347Q722 336 708 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347ZM56 153Q56 168 72 173H708Q722 163 722 153Q722 140 707 133H70Q56 140 56 153Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(389,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-221A\" x=\"0\" y=\"20\"></use>\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"778\" height=\"60\" x=\"833\" y=\"761\"></rect>\n<g transform=\"translate(833,0)\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJAMS-25A1\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(2001,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"550\" y=\"583\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"3122\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(4178,0)\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJAMS-25A1\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"5124\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>The square and the square root cancel each other out, and we're left with the number that we started with.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-225b66b89fc1236c30663b685a487dff\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/225b66b89fc1236c30663b685a487dff\"></div>           \n                </div>        \n                    \n            </div>",
